        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Have You Been Waiting for a Modern Take on Classic Asteroid Shooters?</strong> 🚀</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wait might just be over! <i>Astro Busters</i> brings you a fast-paced space shooter with realistic physics, responsive controls, and thrilling arcade action. Take on missions, upgrade your weapons and ships, and battle fierce enemies in deep space solo or in multiplayer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >December 2025 – Early Access Launch with more levels, new weapons, highscores and 3 modes  Multiplayer (cross-platform) at a lower price. 🚀</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Later – Full Release with CTF Multiplayer, more levels and more at a higher price.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early access version features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer, PvP, Co-op and Waves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New reward system for random sub-tasks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud based Leaderboards and ranked league</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New level keys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrations on damage (Mobile version)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross platform multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and much more...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>See you in space!  :-)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The idea to create this game came from playing old incredibly fun classics like Asteroids, Gravity force and X-Pilot for endless hours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since we couldn't really find a modern version of those games and we really wanted to play such a game both solo and with our friends in multiplayer we decided to develop it ourselves ;-)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that you will like it as much as we do ! </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Have You Been Waiting for a Modern Take on Classic Asteroid Shooters?</strong> 🚀</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wait might just be over! <i>Astro Busters</i> brings you a fast-paced space shooter with realistic physics, responsive controls, and thrilling arcade action. Take on missions, upgrade your weapons and ships, and battle fierce enemies in deep space solo or in multiplayer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >December 2025 – Early Access Launch with more levels, new weapons, highscores and 3 modes  Multiplayer (cross-platform) at a lower price. 🚀</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Later – Full Release with CTF Multiplayer, more levels and more at a higher price.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early access version features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer, PvP, Co-op and Waves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New reward system for random sub-tasks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud based Leaderboards and ranked league</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New level keys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrations on damage (Mobile version)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross platform multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and much more...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>See you in space!  :-)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The idea to create this game came from playing old incredibly fun classics like Asteroids, Gravity force and X-Pilot for endless hours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since we couldn't really find a modern version of those games and we really wanted to play such a game both solo and with our friends in multiplayer we decided to develop it ourselves ;-)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that you will like it as much as we do ! </p>",
